{
  "dom_id": "step-e4237",
  "name": "Example: Translating From the Explicit to the Recursive Formula",
  "problem": "The formula for the $n$th term of a geometric sequence is $a_n = 8 \\cdot 3^n$ for $n\\geq 1.$  What is the recursive formula for this sequence?",
  "worked_solution": "The recursive formula for a geometric sequence is\n\n$$\na_{n+1} = r \\cdot a_n.\n$$\n\nTo complete the formula,  we must determine the common ratio $r$ and state the first term $a_1.$ The first two terms are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =8\\cdot {3}^{1}=8\\cdot 3=24, \\\\ {a}_{2} & =8\\cdot {3}^{2}=8\\cdot 9=72.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the common ratio is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{72}{24}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the recursive formula for the geometric  sequence is\n\n$$\na_{n+1} = 3 a_n, \\quad a_1 = 24, \\quad n \\geq 1.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e4237\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Translating From the Explicit to the Recursive Formula</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e4237\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n          